<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglovaal sees &quot;satisfactory&quot; year.</title>
<headline>Anglovaal sees &quot;satisfactory&quot; year.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African mining and industrial conglomerate Anglovaal Ltd said it expected satisfactory year earnings but the group's units were affected by a number of factors which were difficult to assess.</p>
<p>Half year earnings rose 30 percent to 347.3 million rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
